    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Continus update</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lastest updates:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----2024-12-11-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free play Mode added, enjoy playing all levels freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----2024-11-28-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sensors added, you may choose between various sensors purchased in the warehouse. Carefully configure them!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>PhysioArchitect is a simulation puzzle game designed to promote understanding of physiological concepts. In this game, you step into the role of a developer building neural networks that power artificial intelligences (AIs) to drive robots in completing various tasks. As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock a range of physiological mechanics and ultimately earn prestigious rewards.<br><br>Game Features<br><strong>Intuitive Interface</strong>: Easily place and connect neural cells to construct your neural network AI.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141750/extras/b0e3bf65d43da98176fe101c2322720a.avif?t=1736161906\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br><strong>Customizable Mechanics</strong>: Fine-tune parameters of your AIs to control robotic functions for specific tasks, such as goal kicking, heart beating, and piano playing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141750/extras/277a928c766a9249a3da39a3c70763b5.avif?t=1736161906\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br><strong>Test and Validate</strong>: Run simulations of your AI solutions to complete tasks and earn funding and awards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141750/extras/b29ee5a8750aa100e23245fa3054dcb5.avif?t=1736161906\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br><strong>Optimization Challenges</strong>: Enhance your AI\u2019s efficiency and precision while minimizing resource consumption to earn additional rewards and bonuses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141750/extras/a98cff7d272c4744ea76e8555ba1d0c3.avif?t=1736161906\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br><strong>Progressive Complexity</strong>: Unlock more challenging tasks and advance sensors and components to elevate your AI solutions.<br><strong>Global Competition</strong>: Submit your solutions and compete with players worldwide to evaluate your ranking.<br><strong>Classic Mini Games</strong>: Apply your AI solutions in auto-playing classic mini-games like <i>Pong </i>to experience the capabilities of neural AI.",
    "about_the_game": "PhysioArchitect is a simulation puzzle game designed to promote understanding of physiological concepts. In this game, you step into the role of a developer building neural networks that power artificial intelligences (AIs) to drive robots in completing various tasks. As you progress, you\u2019ll unlock a range of physiological mechanics and ultimately earn prestigious rewards.<br><br>Game Features<br><strong>Intuitive Interface</strong>: Easily place and connect neural cells to construct your neural network AI.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141750/extras/b0e3bf65d43da98176fe101c2322720a.avif?t=1736161906\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br><strong>Customizable Mechanics</strong>: Fine-tune parameters of your AIs to control robotic functions for specific tasks, such as goal kicking, heart beating, and piano playing.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141750/extras/277a928c766a9249a3da39a3c70763b5.avif?t=1736161906\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br><strong>Test and Validate</strong>: Run simulations of your AI solutions to complete tasks and earn funding and awards.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141750/extras/b29ee5a8750aa100e23245fa3054dcb5.avif?t=1736161906\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br><strong>Optimization Challenges</strong>: Enhance your AI\u2019s efficiency and precision while minimizing resource consumption to earn additional rewards and bonuses.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3141750/extras/a98cff7d272c4744ea76e8555ba1d0c3.avif?t=1736161906\" width=480 height=270 /></span><br><br><strong>Progressive Complexity</strong>: Unlock more challenging tasks and advance sensors and components to elevate your AI solutions.<br><strong>Global Competition</strong>: Submit your solutions and compete with players worldwide to evaluate your ranking.<br><strong>Classic Mini Games</strong>: Apply your AI solutions in auto-playing classic mini-games like <i>Pong </i>to experience the capabilities of neural AI.",
